** sch_path: /pdk/sky130A/libs.tech/xschem/sky130_tests/test_short_option.sch
**.subckt test_short_option NET_A NET_C
*.iopin NET_A
*.iopin NET_C
* short x2 : NET_A <--> NET_A
* short x5 : #net1 <--> #net1
* short x1 : NET_E <--> NET_E
